。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、発育の未熟な自分の身体についてかなり不満を持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9746","sourceWorkId":"23855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"総合病院の理事長を父に持ち、ナチュラルに他人を見下すワガママお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に周りからチヤホヤされて育ったため、まるで暴君のように傲岸な態度で振る舞う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"欲したものは必ず手に入れようとする意思の強さがあり、意外と根性はある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしプライドの高さが邪魔をして周囲の助けを得られず、苦労することが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親の命令で、一般的な生活を知るために学園へは電車を使って通学しているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"潔癖気味なところがあり、否応なしに身体が触れ合う満員電車に嫌気が差している。また、発育の未熟な自分の身体についてかなり不満を持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46883"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9746","sourceWorkId":"23855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9746","sourceWorkId":"23855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9746","sourceWorkId":"23855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9746","sourceWorkId":"23855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9746","sourceWorkId":"23855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6af296c1a787f075881d7fbf14688af36db87b135aa9d99b3d7e10745d0d719.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f6a1c88acee1472341baccc615a0f56079f2d42810e8e71bdacb1ddc1e6bce1.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"米島希","creatorId":"vndb:s281","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s281","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s281","name":"米島 希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatu